{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_b876395d7ef6dba26bbedef5f6546ae1ad02712bd4459dd8aee0edb899b46857", "title": "Alexander Hamilton (song)", "text": "\"Alexander Hamilton\" is the opening number for the 2015 musical \"Hamilton\", a musical biography of American Founding Father Alexander Hamilton, which premiered on Broadway in 2015. Lin-Manuel Miranda wrote both the music and lyrics to the song. This song features \"alternately rapped and sung exposition\".", "score": 26.5882}, {"id": "hp_doc_1d79b1d71e31457f4347c775a752780f15cbc127aba734c2ddf34831d3271079", "title": "Hamilton (musical)", "text": "Hamilton: An American Musical is a sung- and rapped-through musical about the life of American Founding Father Alexander Hamilton, with music, lyrics and book by Lin-Manuel Miranda, inspired by the 2004 biography \"Alexander Hamilton\" by historian Ron Chernow. Notably incorporating hip-hop, rhythm and blues, pop music, traditional-style show tunes and color-conscious casting of non-white actors as the Founding Fathers and other historical figures, the musical achieved both critical acclaim and box office success.", "score": 26.5867}, {"id": "hp_doc_858b3fec1742d8487010d4597b9b6447ebf97010bdb72775cca4e93a6360095a", "title": "Alexander Hamilton (Trumbull)", "text": "Alexander Hamilton is a 1792 full-length portrait of Alexander Hamilton by John Trumbull. It is one of multiple paintings John Trumbull made of Alexander Hamilton.", "score": 20.9913}], "remaining_searches": 2}
